      "npc" : "Zyosegirl",
      "text" : "[Zyosegirl]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 239,
      "npc" : "Zyosegirl",
      "text" : "People call me the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 240,
      "npc" : "Zyosegirl",
      "text" : "Sea Lady because I'm"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 241,
      "npc" : "Zyosegirl",
      "text" : "always here working,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 242,
      "npc" : "Zyosegirl",
      "text" : "gathering clams and other"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 243,
      "npc" : "Zyosegirl",
      "text" : "sea creatures to sell. It's"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 244,
      "npc" : "Zyosegirl",
      "text" : "a pretty good living, actually."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 246,
      "npc" : "Zyosegirl",
      "text" : "[Zyosegirl]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 247,
      "npc" : "Zyosegirl",
      "text" : "It's nice to be able to work"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 248,
      "npc" : "Zyosegirl",
      "text" : "outdoors, but someday, I want"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 249,
      "npc" : "Zyosegirl",
      "text" : "to save enough money and move"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 250,
      "npc" : "Zyosegirl",
      "text" : "to the city. I'm still young, you know, and I've got dreams"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 251,
      "npc" : "Zyosegirl",
      "text" : "that I want to fulfill~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 256,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "[Ziyaol]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 257,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "Ahhh, it's nice being"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 258,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "a fisherman. You just"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 259,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "relax and let the fish"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 260,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "come to you. Well, it takes"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 261,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "some skill to catch as much"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 262,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "fish as I do with no effort~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 264,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "[Ziyaol]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 265,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "I like the leisure involved"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 266,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "in my job, but if it's not one"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 267,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "thing, it's another. Yeah, that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 268,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "daughter of mine over there"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 269,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "won't stop harping about "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 270,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "moving to the biiig city."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 272,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "[Ziyaol]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 273,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "Why does she want to leave"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 274,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "me so badly?! But if I don't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 275,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "let her go, she'll run away."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 276,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "What am I going to do with"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 277,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "that girl? Well, I can't really"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 278,
      "npc" : "Ziyaol",
      "text" : "stop her from dreaming..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 283,
      "npc" : "Daeguro",
      "text" : "[Daeguro]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 284,
      "npc" : "Daeguro",
      "text" : "I love playing in"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 285,
      "npc" : "Daeguro",
      "text" : "the sand-- it's so soft"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 286,
      "npc" : "Daeguro",
      "text" : "and clean and pretty!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 287,
      "npc" : "Daeguro",
      "text" : "But when I grow up,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 288,
      "npc" : "Daeguro",
      "text" : "I wanna go to Alberta"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 289,
      "npc" : "Daeguro",
      "text" : "and see everything I can!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 294,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "[Rahasu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 295,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "Hey, I'm Rahasu."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 296,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "If you want to learn"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 297,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "a little more about"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 298,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "Paros Lighthouse, I'll"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 299,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "be happy to tell you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 301,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "Paros Lighthouse?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 301,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "Cancel"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 302,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "[Rahasu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 303,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "For many years, this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 304,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "lighthouse guided many"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 305,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "ships to shore. That was"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 306,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "a long time ago: now this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 307,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "lighthouse sits quietly,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 308,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "unused, but never unloved."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 310,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "[Rahasu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 311,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "Although this place"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 312,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "isn't the center of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 313,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "trade and commerce that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 314,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "it used to be, plenty of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 315,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "people still wander to this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 316,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "area. I wonder why, exactly..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 319,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "[Rahasu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 320,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "Hey, before you leave,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 321,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "you really ought to check"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 322,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "the view from the lighthouse."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 323,
      "npc" : "Rahasu",
      "text" : "It's... It's breathtaking..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 328,
      "npc" : "Hallosu",
      "text" : "[Hallosu]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 329,
      "npc" : "Hallosu",
      "text" : "Hello, this is one of the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 330,
      "npc" : "Hallosu",
      "text" : "lighthouses that make up"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 331,
      "npc" : "Hallosu",
      "text" : "Paros Lighthouse. However,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 332,
      "npc" : "Hallosu",
      "text" : "right now it's undergoing"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 333,
      "npc" : "Hallosu",
      "text" : "renovation, so it's not"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 334,
      "npc" : "Hallosu",
      "text" : "open to the public."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 341,
      "npc" : "Zain",
      "text" : "Would you like to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 342,
      "npc" : "Zain",
      "text" : "board a ship on the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 343,
      "npc" : "Zain",
      "text" : "Reudelus route? You"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 344,
      "npc" : "Zain",
      "text" : "can travel on Reudelus"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 345,
      "npc" : "Zain",
      "text" : "to Alberta or Izlude."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 347,
      "npc" : "Zain",
      "text" : "Alberta - 600 Zeny"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 347,
      "npc" : "Zain",
      "text" : "Izlude - 800 Zeny"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 347,
      "npc" : "Zain",
      "text" : "Cancel"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 363,
      "npc" : "Zain",
      "text" : "Travel by ship is"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 364,
      "npc" : "Zain",
      "text" : "still one of the safest and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 365,
      "npc" : "Zain",
      "text" : "dependable methods of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 366,
      "npc" : "Zain",
      "text" : "transportation. I invite you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 367,
      "npc" : "Zain",
      "text" : "to try Reudelus travel soon~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
